OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine
OL,6,Fevening for most, though rain will
OL,7,Fcontinue across northern Scotland.
OL,8,FOvernight, cloud and patchy rain may
OL,9,Falso spread into parts of Northern
OL,10,FIreland. Dry elsewhere, with clear
OL,11,Fskies allowing it to turn chilly in
OL,12,Fthe countryside.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FNorthern Ireland and much of
OL,15,FScotland will remain cloudy, with
OL,16,Foutbreaks of heavy rain through the
OL,17,Fday. Dry for England and Wales, with
OL,18,Fsunny spells. Warm here, with light
OL,19,Fwinds.
